#
# Cybou targets NixOS and is built through Nix on Linux, but is developed in part from Windows via
# WSL. Without this, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true materialises CRLF in the working
# tree, Nix copies that dirty tree verbatim, and shell fragments embedded in .nix derivations fail
# with `$'\r': command not found` - a build failure with no connection to the change being made.
#
# Normalise everything to LF in both the index and the working tree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
